Package: rladybugdb
Title: R Interface to the 'LadybugDB' Embedded Graph Database
Version: 0.4.5
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raden Muhammad", "Hadi", email = "hadimaster65555@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides an R interface to 'LadybugDB', an embedded columnar graph
    database using the 'Cypher' query language. 'LadybugDB' was formerly known
    as 'Kuzu'. This package uses native 'Rcpp' bindings to
    the 'LadybugDB' C library, requiring no 'Python' runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C++20, CMake (>= 3.15)
